{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":20,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":20,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67611f4429d1fd72f779e","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听起来你一直很努力地想把它想通，可情绪不是靠想明白就能消掉的，越使劲反而越乱。你小时候学会的，大概就是把感受压下去、用道理盖住。那现在，如果不用想明白，只是让那份乱待一会儿，你会觉得害怕吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听起来你一直很努力地想把它想通，可情绪不是靠想明白就能消掉的，越使劲反而越乱。你小时候学会的，大概就是把感受压下去、用道理盖住。那现在，如果不用想明白，只是让那份乱待一会儿，你会觉得害怕吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2275,"promptTokens":2474,"completionTokens":112,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:37"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692422621993255,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67611f4429d1fd72f779d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536977306,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:37","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67611f4429d1fd72f779d","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（声音低了些）嗯……好像是。在家里，情绪这东西说出来也没用，我爸妈更看重把事想明白。可有时候我就是想不明白，越想越乱。<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692422621993255,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67611f4429d1fd72f779e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536977303,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:37","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6760cf4429d1fd72f7794","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听你说“没人提”，我心里也沉了一下。一个孩子在那儿害怕，却得像大人一样装作没事，那份怕只能自己咽下去。现在你心里堵着的时候，是不是也常这样，觉得说出来也没人接得住？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听你说“没人提”，我心里也沉了一下。一个孩子在那儿害怕，却得像大人一样装作没事，那份怕只能自己咽下去。现在你心里堵着的时候，是不是也常这样，觉得说出来也没人接得住？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2388,"promptTokens":2899,"completionTokens":152,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:32"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692127571717434,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6760cf4429d1fd72f7793","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536972366,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:32","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6760cf4429d1fd72f7793","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（沉默了一会儿）就是……我记得小时候有一次家里聚会，我爸那时候病着，可大家还是照常吃饭聊天，好像什么都没发生。我坐在那儿特别害怕，但没人提。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692127571717434,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6760cf4429d1fd72f7794","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536972363,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:32","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67607f4429d1fd72f7789","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"胸口发紧、喘不上气，这些身体反应是真实的，不是你想多了。你刚才提到小时候的事，语气有点不确定，像是不太敢往那边想。没关系，我们不急着下结论。你愿意的话，可以说说那会儿你想到的是什么？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"胸口发紧、喘不上气，这些身体反应是真实的，不是你想多了。你刚才提到小时候的事，语气有点不确定，像是不太敢往那边想。没关系，我们不急着下结论。你愿意的话，可以说说那会儿你想到的是什么？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1688,"promptTokens":2788,"completionTokens":95,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:27"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012429704715901843,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67607f4429d1fd72f7788","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536967272,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67607f4429d1fd72f7788","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（想了想）好像是胸口，发紧，喘不太上气。可这跟我小时候的事有没有关系，我也说不准……<第8轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":16,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012429704715901843,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":2,"sort":5},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67607f4429d1fd72f7789","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536967269,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67602f4429d1fd72f777f","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"记不清梦却带着堵醒过来，那种感觉挺磨人的，像情绪先到了，话还没跟上。不用急着去挖梦的内容。醒来那会儿堵着的时候，你身体上最先感觉到的是哪儿不舒服？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"记不清梦却带着堵醒过来，那种感觉挺磨人的，像情绪先到了，话还没跟上。不用急着去挖梦的内容。醒来那会儿堵着的时候，你身体上最先感觉到的是哪儿不舒服？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1921,"promptTokens":2625,"completionTokens":88,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:22"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":15,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574382526297287,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67602f4429d1fd72f777e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536962333,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67602f4429d1fd72f777e","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"说不上来……有时候是闷，有时候又像被什么揪着。我最近老做梦，醒来心里堵得慌，可记不清梦到什么了。<第7轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":14,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574382526297287,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67602f4429d1fd72f777f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536962330,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af675fef4429d1fd72f7773","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你愿意说出来，就已经很不容易了，这不过分。那种压着的感觉，虽然讲不清，但它一直在，人也会累。它更像闷闷的沉，还是有点发紧的那种？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你愿意说出来，就已经很不容易了，这不过分。那种压着的感觉，虽然讲不清，但它一直在，人也会累。它更像闷闷的沉，还是有点发紧的那种？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1851,"promptTokens":1990,"completionTokens":97,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:18"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":13,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909330684665715,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af675fef4429d1fd72f7772","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536958180,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af675fef4429d1fd72f7772","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……那好吧，记下来。其实我也知道这样问有点过分。（低头）就是最近老觉得心里有东西压着，说不上来。<第6轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":12,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909330684665715,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af675fef4429d1fd72f7773","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536958177,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af675f9f4429d1fd72f7763","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你这么问的时候，好像有点小心，怕被拒绝，也怕自己要求太多。咨询之外我确实没法随时回应你，这一点我得跟你说清楚。不过晚上睡不着时，你可以先把想说的记下来，下次带来一起聊。这样你会不会觉得好一点？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你这么问的时候，好像有点小心，怕被拒绝，也怕自己要求太多。咨询之外我确实没法随时回应你，这一点我得跟你说清楚。不过晚上睡不着时，你可以先把想说的记下来，下次带来一起聊。这样你会不会觉得好一点？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2744,"promptTokens":2247,"completionTokens":198,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:13"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":11,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0097068146961194,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af675f9f4429d1fd72f7762","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536953993,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af675f9f4429d1fd72f7762","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（犹豫）那……我能不能在咨询之外也找你聊聊？比如我晚上睡不着的时候。我不知道这样问是不是不合适。<第5轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":10,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuici